    <briefdescription>
<para>Validates JSON objects against a predefined JSON Schema. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class loads a JSON schema from a file and provides a method to validate JSON configuration files. It is used to ensure that configuration files conform to the expected structure and data types before being used in the simulation. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
